worth|REVIEW: Predicative monetary worth, noun value and worth the effort remain distinct. The noun example extends value to practical importance beyond the source's money example; that extension and adjective taxonomy remain owner-review obligations.
dramatic|PASS: A striking change in lighting is separated from techniques used in theatre. The new definition allows gradual but striking effects; Vietnamese rõ rệt and thuộc sân khấu match their respective examples.
foster|REVIEW: Encouraging trust and caring for a child preserve separate source ordinals and complements. The temporary-care boundary was checked with Oxford; the Vietnamese siblings example needs a gender-neutral overlay and full-batch re-review.
mission|PASS: A rescue team's assigned purpose illustrates the countable task noun without turning every religious or diplomatic usage into the same Sense. Missing walkers translates directly and the infinitive names the task.
page|PASS: Printed or written sheet side is distinguished from a whole leaf. On page and turn a page provide reusable collocations; the diary example does not invent a web-page ordinal or verb proposal.
